{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>中東戰事導致國際燃油價格上揚，港燈今日（26日）公布，11月燃料調整費為每度電55.1仙，即較10月下調4.2仙。連同基本電費，11月份平均淨電費為每度電183仙，較10月份減少2.2%；中電公布，11月燃料調整費為每度電47.4仙，較10月升1.2仙。連同基本電費，平均淨電費為每度電148.6仙，較10月份升0.77%。</p><figure><img alt=\"（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221122/671513867490299904712036.jpeg/eKT-xzQ43Y-j-nmwLEccAHbHilzJKDqxJRLtDzMS7Q8\"/><figcaption>（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T10:00:43.101900+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":169,"images":1,"source":"HK01 社會","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T09:46:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T09:58:21.541555+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T09:58:21.541555+00:00","content_hash":"78d5e7c23ddb3d54ed6f20290816a96f6bd4ecb52fd958ee73462ad49374f728","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}